  "conclusion": [
    "L3112 returns immediately when $C8A4 is zero.",
    "In year 1, event dispatch is blocked while $C8A3 < $C8A4.",
    "Owner slot zero and slots with $C9D9,x nonzero do not run the human event dispatcher.",
    "The first raw RNG byte must be at least 0x10.",
    "On the active path, L982F($1a) returns a one-based-plus-one value that L3112 decrements before passing the module id to L9B03."
